<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100609" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθηρ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθηράω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				451d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὥσπερ κύνες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				466d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>catch</i> or <i>win together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				981.5
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, <i>quest after, reach by efforts</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ δ᾽ οὐ κεκτήμεθα, μίμησις . . ταῦτα
					συνθηρεύεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					156
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>catch hold of, gather up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνεται τὸ λιπαρὸν . . τὰ κάρφη καὶ
					τὰ τοιαῦτα συνθηρεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diocl.Fr.
					147
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>